## ⚡ Hardware & Limits

| Item | Limit |
|------|-------|
| GPU | 1× NVIDIA T4-class (16 GB VRAM) — **not used in mock** |
| CPU | 8 cores |
| RAM | 32 GB |
| Time per video | ≤ 3× video duration (wall-clock) |
| Weights | ≤ 5 GB |
| Internet during eval | **None** |

